/E (This study uses data from the Sri Lanka Labour Force Survey \(LFS\) 2023, conducted by the Department of Census and Statistics \(DCS\). The Labour Force Survey is a nationally representative household survey designed to collect information on labour market participation, employment, and unemployment in Sri Lanka.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
