/E (Youth unemployment in Sri Lanka varies across demographic, educational, and geographic groups. However, these variations are not clearly understood using overall unemployment figures alone. This study aims to analyse youth unemployment and identify the key factors associated with unemployment among youth using data from the Labour Force Survey 2023.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
