/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (For subsequent analysis, individuals classified as not in the labour force were excluded, resulting in a final youth labour force dataset consisting of 1,428 individuals, of whom 1,239 were employed and 189 were unemployed. Additional checks confirmed that the dataset contained no duplicate records, and missing values were assessed to ensure data consistency. These preprocessing steps ensured that the final dataset was clean, well-defined, and suitable for descriptive analysis and statistical modelling of youth unemployment in Sri Lanka.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [26]
>>
